  _headline: "T\xE9rmica garante a luz, e o c\xE9u paga a conta"
  _headlineEn: Thermal plant keeps the lights on; the sky pays
  _body: "Queimando g\xE1s, carv\xE3o ou \xF3leo, a usina liga a qualquer hora. J\xFAlia
    p\xF4s o sensor na janela e depois fechou a janela."
  _bodyEn: "Burning gas, coal or oil, it can start at any hour. J\xFAlia put her
    sensor on the windowsill, then closed the window."
